-- Write a query to print total number of unique hackers who made atleast 1 submission each and
-- find the hacker_id who made most submission on each day
-- If more than one such hacker has a maximum number of submissions print the lowest hacker_id
-- The query hould print this information for each day of the contest sorted by the date

